    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "gym_koori_040_receptionist_00",
      "hash64": "DF57B8C8336F5CE1",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，\\n歡迎光臨霜抹山道館。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "gym_koori_040_receptionist_01",
      "hash64": "DF57B7C8336F5B2E",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳要挑戰絕對零度酷炫技……\\n道館館主古魯夏嗎？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "gym_koori_040_receptionist_02",
      "hash64": "DF57B6C8336F597B",
      "text": "那麼，請讓我帶[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳前往對戰場。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "gym_koori_040_receptionist_03",
      "hash64": "DF57B5C8336F57C8",
      "text": "等[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳準備好後，\\n請隨時告訴我一聲。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 1,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "gym_koori_040_poke_01",
      "hash64": "A9AAA4A6391CB134",
      "text": "吼耶～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "gym_koori_040_koori_00",
      "hash64": "4FB91B84C5B57C58",
      "text": "原來你在這裡啊。[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "gym_koori_040_koori_01",
      "hash64": "4FB91C84C5B57E0B",
      "text": "嗚嗚……好冷……[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "gym_koori_040_koori_02",
      "hash64": "4FB91D84C5B57FBE",
      "text": "……[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳是挑戰者嗎？[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "gym_koori_040_koori_03",
      "hash64": "4FB91E84C5B58171",
      "text": "我是古魯夏。\\n我曾經是個職業的單板滑雪選手，\\r\\n現在是個道館館主。[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "gym_koori_040_koori_04",
      "hash64": "4FB91F84C5B58324",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳滑雪山滑得……\\n嗯……很酷。[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "gym_koori_040_koori_05",
      "hash64": "4FB92084C5B584D7",
      "text": "但是，可別因此而太開心。[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "gym_koori_040_koori_06",
      "hash64": "4FB92184C5B5868A",
      "text": "雪山很危險，\\n會輕易地搞亂[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳人生的道路。[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "gym_koori_040_koori_07",
      "hash64": "4FB92284C5B5883D",
      "text": "寶可夢對戰也是一樣。\\n……不論什麼事情，\\r\\n剛開始熟練時總是最恐怖的。[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "gym_koori_040_koori_08",
      "hash64": "4FB91384C5B56EC0",
      "text": "我真的覺得[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳最好別在\\n這種日子挑戰我……[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "gym_koori_040_koori_09",
      "hash64": "4FB91484C5B57073",
      "text": "……[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳真的要和我對戰？[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "gym_koori_040_select_01",
      "hash64": "51F3FDED0BC782C7",
      "text": "要！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "gym_koori_040_select_02",
      "hash64": "51F3FEED0BC7847A",
      "text": "怎麼辦……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "gym_koori_040_koori_10",
      "hash64": "4FBCA184C5B895E1",
      "text": "好冷的答覆。\\n……太可惜了。[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "gym_koori_040_koori_11",
      "hash64": "4FBCA084C5B8942E",
      "text": "……懸崖勒馬也是一種勇氣。\\n但像[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳這樣的人，\\r\\n終究還是會選擇前進。[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "gym_koori_040_koori_12",
      "hash64": "4FBC9F84C5B8927B",
      "text": "我也只是在盡自己的職責，\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳可別怪我。[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "gym_koori_040_koori_13",
      "hash64": "4FBC9E84C5B890C8",
      "text": "讓我教[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳看清\\n像冰雪般冷酷的現實吧。[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "gym_koori_040_koori_14",
      "hash64": "4FBCA584C5B89CAD",
      "text": "絲毫不畏懼逆境，\\n奮力開拓未來的那股熱情……！[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "gym_koori_040_koori_15",
      "hash64": "4FBCA484C5B89AFA",
      "text": "讓我想起從前的我……[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "gym_koori_040_koori_16",
      "hash64": "4FBCA384C5B89947",
      "text": "不，沒什麼。\\n我得把道館徽章給[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳。[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "gym_koori_040_koori_17",
      "hash64": "4FBCA284C5B89794",
      "text": "什麼？為了慶祝及格，\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳想和我拍一張紀念照……？[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "gym_koori_040_koori_18",
      "hash64": "4FBC9984C5B88849",
      "text": "嗚嗚……這種會冷場的事\\n我通常很排斥的。\\r\\n沒辦法……給[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳特別待遇吧。[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "gym_koori_040_koori_badge",
      "hash64": "5219C9B7E108FDE3",
      "text": "只要有[VAR 0x0200(0001)]個道館徽章，\\n等級[VAR 0x0201(0002)]以下的寶可夢應該就會\\r\\n比較容易捕捉，也會聽[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳的話。[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0200",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0201",
          "args_hex": [
            "0002"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 54,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "gym_koori_040_koori_badge_all",
      "hash64": "63225360EE7BC80F",
      "text": "只要有８個道館徽章，\\n不論什麼寶可夢應該都能捉到，\\r\\n不論[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳下多冷的指示，牠們也都會聽話。[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
